{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52799","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 郭慎微","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"承明常谒帝，函谷坐成仙。\n少别商山下，长探禹穴前。\n云迎出关驭，花待过江船。\n欲识恩华重，宸章七曜悬。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭慎微","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52799.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52799","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}